[0.001, "o", " succeeded in 0ms:\r\n   674\t\r\n   675\t## Task 1: Clarify the personal AI-content-to-learning-podcast scenario and first Skill shape, success\r\n   676\t\r\n   677\t### rollout_summary_files\r\n   678\t\r\n   679\t- rollout_summaries/2026-07-29T14-28-00-ucsV-personal_ai_learning_podcast_skill_scenario.md (cwd=/Users/bytedance/Documents/\u5b66\u4e60, rollout_path=/Users/bytedance/.codex/sessions/2026/07/29/rollout-2026-07-29T22-28-00-019fae46-74ce-7ec2-90b6-874e872e95d1.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-29T14:32:44+00:00, thread_id=019fae46-74ce-7ec2-90b6-874e872e95d1, validated personal-use framing and a manual-input first loop)\r\n   680\t\r\n   681\t### keywords\r\n   682\t\r\n   683\t- AI\u5b66\u4e60\u64ad\u5ba2, \u79c1\u4eba\u5b66\u4e60\u64ad\u5ba2, \u5185\u5bb9\u79ef\u538b, \u5fae\u4fe1\u7fa4, \u516c\u4f17\u53f7, \u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66, \u89c6\u9891, Skill, Agent, \u53cc\u4eba\u95ee\u7b54, TTS, \u788e\u7247\u65f6\u95f4, \u5de5\u4f5c\u5224\u65ad, Harness Engineering, Agent\u8bc4\u6d4b\r\n   684\t\r\n   685\t## User preferences\r\n   686\t\r\n   687\t- when exploring this direction, the user corrected: \u201c\u6211\u6ca1\u6709\u8bf4\u8981\u628a\u8fd9\u4e2a\u64ad\u5ba2\u4f5c\u4e3a\u4e00\u4e2a\u4ea7\u54c1\u2026\u2026\u4e0d\u8981\u5148\u60f3\u8981\u5199"]
[0.0, "o", "PRD\u6216\u8005\u4ea7\u54c1\u80fd\u4e0d\u80fd\u5356\u51fa\u53bb\u201d -> establish the personal real-use scenario and sustained value before PRD, MVP, or commercialization framing [Task 1]\r\n   688\t- when choosing a starting point, the user asked to first make \u201c\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u7528\u7740\u53ef\u4ee5\u7684\u2026\u2026\u5de5\u5177\u3001skill \u6216 agent\u201d -> default to a lightweight, shareable personal workflow; colleague sharing should follow successful personal use rather than define the first build [Task 1]\r\n   689\t- for audio learning, the user dislikes robotic \u201c\u542c\u63a8\u6587\u201d reading and wants natural voice, two-person Q&A, pacing, and organization -> do research editing, deduplication, explanation, and source traceability rather than verbatim TTS [Task 1]\r\n   690\t\r\n   691\t## Reusable knowledge\r\n   692\t\r\n   693\t- The target outcome is not merely \u201cgenerate a podcast\u201d: turn an AI-content backlog into material that can be absorbed in fragmented time, understood, and used to form work judgment. The observed chain is important content \u2192 forwarded to a WeChat group to avoi"]
[0.0, "o", "d losing it \u2192 backlog/no reading time \u2192 commute/walking/chores audio time \u2192 need for selection, organization, and explanation. [Task 1]\r\n   694\t- First-version personal Skill: accept manually submitted links, screenshots, or videos \u2192 extract \u2192 deduplicate/classify \u2192 verify official sources where needed \u2192 select by time budget \u2192 generate a two-person explanatory script \u2192 synthesize natural audio \u2192 output audio plus show notes with original links. Suggested trigger: \u201c\u628a\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u53d1\u6765\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u505a\u6210\u4e00\u671f12\u5206\u949f\u7684\u901a\u52e4\u64ad\u5ba2\u3002\u201d [Task 1]\r\n   695\t- Useful scenario handles are daily AI intelligence, single-topic deep learning, work-prep briefing, and weekly cognition review. \u201cAI product manager host + researcher\u201d is a proposed program format: the host probes novelty, concept differences, evaluation boundaries, and work impact; the researcher covers definitions, mechanisms, cases, fact/opinion distinction, and product implications. [Task 1]\r\n   696\t- Test continuous real use for two"]
[0.0, "o", " weeks before upgrading to an Agent. Look for sustained submission, willingness to finish listening versus original-text reading, retained understanding, and work application. Upgrade triggers include an automatic inbox, scheduled generation, learned-content memory, skip/follow-up/save adaptation, or proactive topic-progress reminders. [Task 1]\r\n   697\t- Proposed 10\u201315 / 20\u201330 / 15 / 30\u201340 minute budgets for daily intelligence / deep topic / briefing / weekly review are design hypotheses, not validated fixed preferences. [Task 1]\r\n   698\t\r\n   699\t## Failures and how to do differently\r\n   700\t\r\n   701\t- Symptom: the conversation jumps to product positioning, MVP, PRD, commercialization, WeChat auto-capture, anti-scraping, or full collaboration -> cause: the personal value-validation question was replaced with a product-build question -> fix: confirm whether the user is exploring a personal workflow, validating demand, or designing a sellable product; start with manual content submission and the core list"]
[0.0, "o", "ening loop. [Task 1]\r\n   702\t- Symptom: validation asks whether \u201c\u5927\u5bb6\u89c9\u5f97\u6709\u9700\u6c42\u201d -> cause: abstract interest is mistaken for use evidence -> fix: measure whether the user repeatedly hands material to the workflow, finishes episodes, remembers/understands them, and uses them at work. [Task 1]\r\n   703\t\r\n   704\t# Task Group: /Users/bytedance/Downloads/zip Knowledge Center static prototype private Sites deployment\r\n"]
